B.K8=new A.O("ricotta","White Cream Drips","cellar",1,"A trail of thick white cream leading away from the outline. You taste it (professionally). Sweet ricotta \u2014 not custard. Mrs. Senclair was filled with vanilla custard, so this came out of somebody else. It lies on top of the spilled custard, so it fell afterwards.",B.bS,B.i,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.Jv=new A.O("flakes","Pastry Flakes","cellar",2,"Pressed into the spilled custard beside the outline: a few crisp, bubbly flakes of FRIED pastry shell. Mrs. Senclair was baked choux. These broke off somebody else during the struggle.",B.fk,B.d7,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
