B.K6=new A.O("mudprint","Heel Print","cellar",1,"A heel print pressed into the spilled custard beside the outline, in the red clay of the strawberry beds. It is on top of the custard, and the clay was still wet when it was made.",B.lk,B.Hd,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
