B.KI=new A.O("prints","Prints on the Iron","",0,"Two sets of prints came up under the powder. Penny Cotta's are old and faint, all along the wooden handle: she irons the sheets. Over them, on the hot sole plate itself, is one sharp thumb where somebody wiped it in a hurry. It is Graham Cracker's.",B.bj,B.bg,null,B.j,B.c,!1,"churlock")
